    "description": "Vendored copy of the modality vocabulary euler-loading emits, so that euler-dataset-contract can assert against it without taking a dependency on euler-loading. Refresh this file when loaders.json changes: the drift test in tests/test_modality_inventory.py fails when a type recorded here has no inventory entry.",
    "notes": [
      "modality_types holds the distinct values of the type field, each with the loader.function pairs that emit it.",
      "loader_function_names holds every loader function name. Not all of them are modality names: read_intrinsics and read_extrinsics are accessors, and reference_rgb is a role rather than an identity (plan section 2.4). Only class_segmentation and lidar_point_cloud appear in the inventory alias map, because the plan's section 5.3 names them."
    ]
  },
